5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hello everyone! I am so excited to start this adventure with you all.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Good morning. Let us proceed with caution and observe each other closely.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, hi. I’m a bit nervous, but I’ll try my best to help.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Welcome, dear children. Let us find the truth together with kindness.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello! I hope we can all work well together to keep the village safe.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,I think we should trust each other first. No one is a wolf yet!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Trust is good, but suspicion is necessary. We must be vigilant.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with George. It’s better to be safe than sorry, I guess.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,A gentle heart is strong. Let us listen to one another carefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I feel the same. We need to share our thoughts openly to find the wolf.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@George, why are you so serious? It’s just a game, right?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, I am serious because lives are at stake. Do not underestimate the danger.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I don’t want anyone to get hurt. Please be nice to each other.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Rin, your energy is lovely. George, your caution is wise. Balance is key.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I like Shizue’s idea. Let’s keep the mood light but stay alert.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, okay. I’ll try to be more serious. Good night, everyone!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,Good night. May the truth reveal itself.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Good night. I hope we can sleep well.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sweet dreams, everyone. May peace guide us.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Good night. I’ll think about what to say tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
