31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! I had a weird dream about a big dog.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,Good morning. Dreams are often meaningless. Let us focus on the task.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hi. I’m still a little tired, but I’m ready to talk.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, my dears. I have a feeling about one of you.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello! I’m ready to help find the werewolf. Let’s get started.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, what feeling? You look mysterious!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, if you have information, please share it. We need facts.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I don’t know much, but I’ll listen to what you say.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I have divined one player. The result is clear. I will speak now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Please tell us, Shizue. We trust your judgment.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,Is it me? I don’t think I’m a wolf!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,I am not the wolf. I have been here for years.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
