44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I have confirmed that George is a werewolf. Please vote for him.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,Oh no! George is the wolf? I didn’t expect that.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@George, you’re the wolf? That’s so surprising!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,That is a lie. Shizue is mistaken. I am innocent.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I believe Shizue. She seems very sure about it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am certain, George. The divination does not lie. Please accept it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. We should vote for George to save the village.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
